    "desc": "Linguistic survey of the languages of Africa, including typological and historical connections between languages, individual and comparative surveys of sound systems, word structures, sentence structures, semantics, and sociolinguistic properties of a representative selection of languages. Credit will be granted for only one of AFST 308 or LING 308 Equivalency: LING 308",
