    "cred": 3,
    "desc": "The sources (literary, epigraphical and other) for Athens' emergence as one of the two leading city-states in late archaic and classical Greece and the stages by which her empire grew. Credit will be granted for only one of CLST 355 or AMNE 316. Equivalency: CLST 355.",
    "prer": "One of CLST 231, AMNE 215"
