    "desc": "Biological process engineering in the fields of biotechnology and biomedical engineering; enzymatic and cellular kinetics; cell culture, bioreactor mass transport and process development; bioreactor design and operation. Critical analysis of recent biological engineering research articles. Credit will be granted for only one of CHBE 381 or CHBE 560. [3-0-2].",
