    "name": "Strategic Management",
    "cred": 3,
    "desc": "Concepts and processes for the strategic management of private sector, single and multi-business unit enterprises are analysed using the case method. Methodologies which draw on economic and organizational theory are integrated to form the foundations for strategic analyses. Credit will be granted for only one of COMM 491 or COEC 491. Equivalency: COEC 491.",
    "prer": "Fourth-year standing. Either (a) all of COMM 390, COMM 395 or (b) COMM 396"
