    "prer": "Either (a) all of MECH 220, MECH 221 or (b) MATH 255 and one of ELEC 201, ELEC 202, ELEC 204, EECE 251, EECE 253; or (c) all of ELEC 204, ELEC 221, ENPH 270, MATH 255"
