    "cred": 3,
    "desc": "Overview of pulp and paper operations. Conversion of wood to fibre through mechanical or chemical pulping, processing of recycled fibre, the papermaking process and paper converting operations. Contemporary developments. [3-0-0].",
    "prer": "None"
