    "name": "Electroacoustic Music",
    "cred": "3-6",
    "desc": "Study of acoustics, audio technology, and electroacoustic composition. Composition of original works using the UBC Electroacoustic Music Studio or students' own software/hardware.",
    "prer": "MUSC 119 and one of MUSC 100, MUSC 103. Permission of instructor is also required"
