    "_id": "2f3df7d5eae508123db6fc59",
    "name": "Occupational Therapy Practice: Fieldwork III",
    "cred": 9,
    "desc": "Evidence of integration and synthesis of complex knowledge and skills provided throughout the MOT program to demonstrate Occupational Therapy advanced competencies for a total of 14 weeks of supervised fieldwork experience in affiliated health agencies.  2016 1874 East Mall Vancouver,\n                 BC\n                 Canada V6T 1Z1 About UBC UBC Campuses Calendar Sections",
