    "desc": "The study of family in social and economic contexts. It is recommended that students complete one of SOCI 100, SOCI 101, SOCI 102 or SOCI 200 before taking this course. Credit will be granted for only one of SOCI 441 and FMST 440. Equivalency: FMST 440. Restricted to students with second-year standing or above.",
